==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 12.67 seconds<sup>380f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rathalos (Enemy)|Rathalos]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 53.33~80 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

